            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pada kondisi pertama, periksa apakah <code>grade</code> tidak sama dengan <code>\"A\"</code>. Pada kondisi kedua, periksa apakah <code>subject</code> sama dengan <code>\"Math\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"subject = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Math&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"grade = \" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" grade != \" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Give \" /><text value=\"{subject}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" a chance&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" subject == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Math&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Today's a great day for solving equations!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;grade&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;subject&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Today's a great day for solving equations!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>grade</code>, di